{"data":{"attachmentkeynames":["rs"],"desc":"Sends a conversation and optional tool definitions to the configured LLM and returns {kind: text|tool_calls|error, content|tool_calls, assistant_message}. THE provider engine: LLM= in runtime/agent/botd.properties picks an arm, and each arm speaks its provider's own dialect - VLLM and OPENAI use the OpenAI chat-completions wire, GEMINI uses native generateContent (system_instruction, safetySettings BLOCK_NONE, functionDeclarations, named blocks), OLLAMA uses native /api/chat (keep_alive, options). Every dialect normalizes into the same OpenAI-shaped result, so callers are dialect-agnostic. Per-arm keys and <ARM>_HEADERS cover any auth scheme; any other LLM= value dispatches LLM_CTL=lib:ctl:cmd. Retries only 408/429/5xx/transport.","import":"use flowlang::datastore::DataStore;\nuse flowlang::command::Command;\nuse ndata::data::Data;\nuse std::collections::HashMap;\n","params":[{"name":"messages","type":"JSONArray"},{"name":"tools","type":"JSONArray"}],"returntype":"JSONObject","type":"rust"},"id":"ytohmk19f70b2c09ck7ce2","readers":[],"time":1786031996381,"username":"system","writers":[]}